  "description": "Seven-layer salad is potluck food—not exactly the kind of dish you'd serve at a dinner party or holiday gathering. That's too bad, because it offers one serious advantage: It's meant to be made ahead. I decided to take the concept and upgrade it a bit with some more seasonal and holiday meal-appropriate ingredients.",
